## Events Entertainment

African drum and dance performances are high energy, colourful and engaging. The pulsating rhythms from the drums, a tribal fusion made up of solo djembe, dun duns and high energy movement from the dancers demonstrates the rich diversity and feeling of West African rhythm.

With an upbeat groove and unstoppable pulse this show is sure to get the crowd entranced. This is a raw African explosion with eye catching costume not to be missed!

Organic African Infusion mixed with raw beats and eye tempting treats!

See incredibly skilled percussionists and dancers come together and give you the tastiest performance you've seen in a long time!

## Do you need a 20 minute show to welcome your events?

There are dancers, drummers, crazy African costumes and drums! Lots of them! These performances can be on stage, roving, indoors, outdoors and can also include an interactive element.  This is an explosive show that is sure to kick off your event with a WOW! Be immersed into ancient rhythms of Africa with traditional rhythms, authentic instruments, upbeat, feet stomping African goodness. A show to make your audience want to dance.

![](/media/2017/12/Events_Header_Large1.jpg)

## Do you need entertainment for your events?

Are you looking for unforgettable entertainment on your special day? Rhythm Culture can provide your ceremony and/or reception with the perfect performance to suit your theme. Background music on traditional West African instruments can be the perfect world music session for your gathering.

## Would you like an interactive show?

A traditional show with pulsing West African beats and drumming to make your family and friends feet lift off the floor!?

Would you like to get everyone up dancing and drumming? The options are endless.

